      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Open Profile for DICE says that info should be \"CDI_Attest\" for attestation keys.\n\nWhere does it say that? (I\u0027m sure it does, I just can\u0027t find it.)\n\nIf the RKP VM has changed, it should need to re-attest? Which suggests that CDI_Attest would be more correct.\n\nIf we use the sealing ID then the HMAC key will almost never change, which in itself seems a bad thing.",
